senses.gloss:
mahāsahā
(1) = māṣaparṇī (Amarakośa 2, 4, 139; Bpn, guḍūcyādivarga 55; Ḍa. on
Su.Sū. 38, 4 and U.42, 113; Dha.nigh. 1, 136; Dgv, nr. 116; DGV 2-3, p. 651;
Hṛdayadīpaka 104; Kai.Nigh., oṣadhivarga 104cd-105; Ma.nigh. 1, 88; Na
1, nr. 131; Nadk. 1, nr. 1133; Nś. 210; Pa.ra. 115-116; Rā.nigh. 3, 170-172;
Siddhasāra-Nigh. 13; Śivakoṣa 538cd; Soḍhalanigh. 1, 189cd-191ab);
(2) = kubjaka (Bpn, puṣpavarga 37; Dha.nigh. 5, 146) = kubjakā (Ma.
nigh. 3, 88) = vakrakaṇṭaka (comm. on Śivakoṣa 538):
a) Rosa brunonii Lindl. = R. moschata Hook. f., non Mill. nec
Herrm. (Bpn, puṣpavarga 37: R. moschata Herrm.; Nadk. 1, nr. 2152:
R. moschata Mill. = R. pubescens = R. glandulifera; see Hooker
2, p. 367 and WIRM 9, p. 66 on the nomenclature);
b) R. centifolia Linn. (KB 2, p. 981-982);
(3) = jalakubjaka (Kai.Nigh., oṣadhivarga 1480): unidentified;
(4) = rājataraṇī (Rā.nigh. 10, 246) = rājataruṇī (Rā.nigh., ed. Tripā-
ṭhī, 10, 127): unidentified, but probably a kind of rose;
(5) = amilāta (Nś. 245) = amlāta (Nś. 245) = amlāna (Amarakośa 2, 4,
74: Kai.Nigh., oṣadhivarga 1047-1048; Śivakoṣa 538) (on these see above);
(6) = murā (Śivakoṣa 387);
(7) Gomphrena globosa Linn. (MW; PW);
(8) Holarrhena antidysenterica Wall. = Wrightia antidysenterica J.
Grah. (MW).
